      "value": "Great news, update 1535 has fixed my issue!  However the issue the other user had with their avatar (shown above with the rotation constraint on a physbone) seems to still be broken, as I am not the person with the problem it may be a bit difficult for me to relay the issue.  I'll attempt to troubleshoot with them and if not, encourage posting to this thread about the issue if we can't figure it out.",
